  "ruleText": "Rev 1612.07 Form DP-144, Communications Services Tax Registration Change Request. A retailer changing its address, name, or entity shall complete and file Form DP-144, communications services tax registration change request.\n\nSource. #6336, eff 9-24-96 (from Rev 1612); ss and moved by #8178, eff 9-24-04 (from Rev 1611.09); ss by #10213, eff 10-24-12 (from Rev 1611.09); renumbered by #13002 (formerly Rev 1611.08); ss by #13553, eff 2-7-23 (formerly Rev 1612.08) (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Rev 1600)\n\nAppendix",
